{"id":632,"gn":"Pokémon Fourmi Dure","ft":["Ils portent une armure de fer et se regroupent pour contrer les attaques de leurs prédateurs, les Aflamanoir.","Ils creusent des galeries dans les montagnes. Les tunnels des Fermite sont de vrais labyrinthes.","Ils travaillent de concert pour protéger leur colonie des terribles attaques de leur prédateur naturel, Aflamanoir.","Il dépose ses Œufs tout au fond de son terrier. Lorsqu’un Aflamanoir l’attaque, il se défend à l’aide de ses mandibules.","Sa grande mâchoire réduit même les rochers en miettes. Il se bat avec sa colonie pour protéger ses Œufs des attaques des Dunaconda."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":1,"23":2,"24":0,"25":2,"26":0,"33":3,"34":4},"gr":4,"cr":90,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Insectoïde"],"gw":"medium","gm":{"swcrown":[0,101],"sw":[0,316,2,101],"xy":[2,106],"b2w2":[0,194],"bw":[0,138]},"f":{"632":{"n":"Fermite","t":["bug","steel"],"s":[58,109,112,48,48,109],"h":0.3,"w":33,"a":[[68,0],[55,0],[54,1]],"av":["swcrown","sw","xy","b2w2","bw"],"ls":[{"l":[[210,1],[28,1],[11,4],[232,8],[251,12],[450,16],[44,20],[97,24],[91,28],[404,32],[242,36],[319,40],[442,44],[494,48],[334,52],[12,56]],"m":[86,91,97,103,156,157,164,173,182,201,203,213,214,226,242,251,263,270,276,317,334,404,412,416,421,422,430,442,444,496,514,707],"e":[175,368,522,611,660],"t":[796,806]},{"l":[[12,1],[334,1],[319,1],[11,1],[28,1],[210,6],[44,11],[97,16],[232,21],[450,26],[242,31],[442,36],[91,41],[494,46],[404,51],[334,56],[12,61],[319,66]],"m":[15,70,86,91,92,104,156,157,164,182,201,207,213,214,216,218,237,249,263,317,332,397,404,412,416,421,430,444,468,496,514,522,590],"e":[103,185,203,226,422,431]},{"l":[[11,1],[28,1],[210,6],[44,11],[97,16],[232,21],[450,26],[242,31],[442,36],[91,41],[494,46],[404,51],[334,56],[12,61],[319,66]],"m":[15,70,86,91,92,104,156,157,164,182,201,207,213,216,218,237,249,263,317,332,397,404,412,416,421,430,444,468,496,514,522],"e":[103,185,203,226,422,431],"t":[173,214,276,283,334,442,450]},{"l":[[11,1],[28,1],[210,6],[44,11],[97,1